an animated fan retelling for the Foot All FC channel, in the channel's own "Night Match Toon" style (see STYLE.md).
Unofficial: not made or endorsed by UEFA, the Czech or German football associations or any broadcaster. No crests, competition marks,
broadcast footage or real likenesses are used; all characters are original vector cartoons drawn in code, kits are generic colours.
